<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
        }

        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }

        .header {
            background-color: #2e8b57;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
        }

        .logo {
            max-width: 200px;
            height: auto;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 30px 20px;
        }

        .refund-details {
            background: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            background-color: #28a745;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }

        .refund-info {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 15px;
            background: #e8f5e8;
            border-radius: 5px;
            border-left: 4px solid #28a745;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .refund-amount {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #28a745;
        }

        .transaction-details {
            background: #f2f2f2;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        .transaction-details h4 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #333;
        }

        .transaction-details p {
            margin: 5px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <a href="{{FRONTEND_URL}}">
                <img src="{{host}}/public/images/logo.png" alt="VapeHub Logo" class="logo" />
            </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <h2>Refund Confirmation</h2>
            <p>Hello {{userName}},</p>
            <p>We're writing to confirm that your refund has been processed successfully. The refund amount will be credited back to your original payment method.</p>
            
            <div class="refund-details">
                <h3>Refund Summary</h3>
                <p><strong>Order Number:</strong> #{{orderCode}}</p>
                <p><strong>Order ID:</strong> {{orderUniqueId}}</p>
                <p><strong>Order Date:</strong> {{orderDate}}</p>
                <p><strong>Refund Status:</strong> <span class="status-badge">{{status}}</span></p>
                
                <div class="refund-info">
                    <h4>Refund Amount</h4>
                    <div class="refund-amount">{{refundCurrency}} {{refundAmount}}</div>
                    <p><small>This amount will be credited back to your original payment method within 3-5 business days.</small></p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="transaction-details">
                <h4>Transaction Details</h4>
                <p><strong>Transaction ID:</strong> {{transactionId}}</p>
                <p><strong>Reversal ID:</strong> {{reversalId}}</p>
                <p><strong>Refund Reason:</strong> {{reversalReason}}</p>
                <p><strong>Processed Date:</strong> {{currentDate}}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="refund-info">
                <h3>What happens next?</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>The refund will be processed within 3-5 business days</li>
                    <li>You'll receive a credit to your original payment method</li>
                    <li>If you have any questions, please contact our customer service team</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <p>Thank you for your patience. If you have any questions about this refund, please don't hesitate to contact us.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Need help with your refund? Our customer service team is here to assist you.</p>
            <p>Email: support@vapehub.com | Phone: +44 123 456 7890</p>
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} VapeHub. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html> 